    {
      "speaker": "jim",
      "text": "Because they get smarter. Like how cars used to come with a manual and you could fix anything on it without any special tools... but now they're all about black boxes and you need",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pause_after": 0.55,
      "rhythm": {
        "human_load": 0.45,
