        "version": 1,
        "interaction_tempo": "normal",
        "cognitive_intensity": "medium",
        "last_turn_ms": 0.0
      },
      "line_number": 2,
      "generated_by": "llamacpp",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0002_279c9c32"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "phil",
      "text": "Oh, that's right! The shift from mechanical to electrical systems made diagnosis easier because of the digital information in cars. But wait, why does that make repairs harder? It",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "pause_after": 0.35,
      "rhythm": {
        "human_load": 0.45,
        "desync_risk": 0.448,
        "turn_latency_ms": 0.0,
        "tempo": "normal",
        "intensity": "medium",
        "verbosity": "medium",
        "cooldown_until_ms": 1791293139759,
        "version": 1,
        "interaction_tempo": "normal",
        "cognitive_intensity": "medium",
        "last_turn_ms": 0.0
      },
      "line_number": 3,
      "generated_by": "llamacpp",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0003_df5a8922"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jim",
      "text": "Because with each upgrade, manufacturers add more layers of complexity. Each new feature requires additional sensors and software, so the tools needed become more specialized. You",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pause_after": 0.55,
      "rhythm": {
        "human_load": 0.45,
        "desync_risk": 0.448,
        "turn_latency_ms": 0.0,
        "tempo": "normal",
        "intensity": "medium",
        "verbosity": "medium",
        "cooldown_until_ms": 1791293139759,
        "version": 1,
        "interaction_tempo": "normal",
        "cognitive_intensity": "medium",
        "last_turn_ms": 0.0
      },
      "line_number": 4,
      "generated_by": "llamacpp",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0004_d47f3f5c"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "phil",
      "text": "The idea of cars being more complex now seems a bit daunting. I can see how each upgrade adds layers.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "pause_after": 0.35,
      "rhythm": {
        "human_load": 0.45,
        "desync_risk": 0.448,
        "turn_latency_ms": 0.0,
