      "generated_by": "llamacpp",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0011_7db30fb3"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jim",
      "text": "But wait, are all updates like that? What about older devices or appliances where they might have made some backward compatible options?",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pause_after": 0.55,
      "rhythm": {
        "human_load": 0.45,
