      "generated_by": "llamacpp",
      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0012_fcf0153f"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "phil",
      "text": "Interesting point! Maybe not all, but certainly many. I wonder if there's a trend towards making more backward compatible features available as manufacturers push for more updated",
      "emotion": "warm",
