      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0013_f340d1d0"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jim",
      "text": "Yes, the industry is noticing that too. There are now services where you can buy an updated version of older tools or even modify some devices to work with legacy diagnostics.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pause_after": 0.55,
      "rhythm": {
