      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0016_fec71bd5"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "jim",
      "text": "Exactly! I remember when my car had a computerized emissions system; the diagnostics were all over the place. Mechanics said they couldn't even recognize the old codes anymore. It",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pause_after": 0.55,
      "rhythm": {
