      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0019_04d75b12"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "phil",
      "text": "As we delve deeper into this topic, I'm starting to understand how the shift from traditional repair shops to online platforms has changed things. It's like the old days when you'd",
