      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0021_dd13fc07"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "phil",
      "text": "So if they're moving towards online diagnostics or parts, that could really complicate repairs further. How does that affect consumers who don't have access to those services?",
      "emotion": "warm",
