      "segment_index": 1,
      "segment_title": "Part 1",
      "canonical_line_id": "canonical_v0001_line_0022_257dc027"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "phil",
      "text": "Yeah, there's a risk of dependency on these online platforms because they offer quick solutions. But without them, mechanics have to dig deeper into the machinery and understand it",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "pause_after": 0.35,
      "rhythm": {
